&_nc_oc=AdoqPDaIITtHNDvsF--vG8youDPhzihFVebhHaJ3et-SvoC2Ccb3tckDSYxntKPocUA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afxka28MkzExXFhEALlVelijpxt-X80TxFKhuPTX-cqRJQ&oe=69CE4FFE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rnr5aKJMEVAQ7kNvwFa_Klo&_nc_oc=AdqRPhHjkMbLWfePlgM4qF-ePwOMd-x2xhkIzYfoHyb3yf4Xo2EsDmI2GjjCfFfDKtA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyscCQOQWccpw0B6lriZF5UThD1xeLaB0DQK0aeWKSv1Q&oe=69CE60FC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mpMQ-JoICEYQ7kNvwE2Zgq-&_nc_oc=AdrJ2Gltm20aIM7_QruNMHtqRH5B3ZFWS9yyDNAqJZZPtMpMXg6HZ4FV1NbX2nptxv8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxmEfIFxNS5PLz9wijoWryn-1eXKtgYWI5BNttJtieiYw&oe=69CE7F87"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RQ5lUTm6FdoQ7kNvwFiMC8K&_nc_oc=AdrWvc7FMNB6a395aYemoAt0TF6SNy4s0pc6PiN_BzWWX5-5XwQ8HNK4L4uCXLPJBu4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyN-UVn-FMa_Gj8UN-eoNPLKdLChOhDjWRBKr6Y87m4gg&oe=69CE6B55"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AustJro9TWsQ7kNvwHfU2Yo&_nc_oc=AdpDpuniKje2tqZgrk5dcMwe451s5kflBC5MS_WAPHRyqZ_yztRavDtQlDygFkVsGJk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzIStLwGVC4a33P3mOo6R4pIWgX_GXY4b3Bkot2-Y5-ow&oe=69CE77E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.